      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⑤ NCCL 算法选择策略",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⑤ NCCL 算法选择策略",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sel-left",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 1180,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 160,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e67700",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1133,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "sel-left-t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 65,
      "y": 1190,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1134,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "消息大小 vs 算法选择\n\n• 小消息 (<256KB): Tree 算法\n  延迟 O(log N), 带宽利用率低\n• 大消息 (>256KB): Ring 算法\n  延迟 O(N), 带宽利用率最优 2(N-1)/N\n• NCCL 自动探测拓扑, 选最优算法\n• 环境变量: NCCL_ALGO=RING/TREE 可手动指定",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "消息大小 vs 算法选择\n\n• 小消息 (<256KB): Tree 算法\n  延迟 O(log N), 带宽利用率低\n• 大消息 (>256KB): Ring 算法\n  延迟 O(N), 带宽利用率最优 2(N-1)/N\n• NCCL 自动探测拓扑, 选最优算法\n• 环境变量: NCCL_ALGO=RING/TREE 可手动指定",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sel-right",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 1180,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 160,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#d0ebff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1135,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "sel-right-t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 525,
      "y": 1190,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1136,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NCCL 拓扑感知机制\n\n• 检测: NVLink / NVSwitch / PCIe / IB / RoCE\n• 节点内: NVLink 优先构建 ring/tree\n• 节点间: IB / RoCE 建立 channel\n• 多 ring: 利用多条 NVLink 并行传输\n• Double Binary Tree: 两棵互补树\n  同时利用上下行带宽, 带宽翻倍",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NCCL 拓扑感知机制\n\n• 检测: NVLink / NVSwitch / PCIe / IB / RoCE\n• 节点内: NVLink 优先构建 ring/tree\n• 节点间: IB / RoCE 建立 channel\n• 多 ring: 利用多条 NVLink 并行传输\n• Double Binary Tree: 两棵互补树\n  同时利用上下行带宽, 带宽翻倍",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sel-summary",
      "type": "text",
